  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"ude3d4dc9\" id=\"ude3d4dc9\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2e784bd9\" id=\"u2e784bd9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">基础不错</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u79c6d800\" id=\"u79c6d800\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">【做过几个项目对回调c++11特性、以及语法熟练的人】：这里只需要十天内，每天5-6个小时左右，就可以学习完这个项目。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub7020709\" id=\"ub7020709\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1d986bbc\" id=\"u1d986bbc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">代码小白</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub95fd16c\" id=\"ub95fd16c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">，这里我个人的建议先去了解回调是什么，比如function、智能指针这些。当然你也可以先看遇到不会的再去找资料：预计时间20天内，每天5-6个小时，当然因人而异变。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9c992e39\" id=\"u9c992e39\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7e10c6b9\" id=\"u7e10c6b9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">目前代码总量是在2000行</span><span data-lake-id=\"ube9b4d4a\" id=\"ube9b4d4a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">，但是省去了</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaff8f930\" id=\"uaff8f930\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">补充工具类的部分内容。  </span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u22fcce32\" id=\"u22fcce32\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u51e72d0b\" id=\"u51e72d0b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">​</span></strong><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u28d6541a\" id=\"u28d6541a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uee46c420\" id=\"uee46c420\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">本项目文档讲解的功能是很全的</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub19dd4dd\" id=\"ub19dd4dd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">，就是按照陈硕（官方）的代码来：</span><a href=\"https://github.com/chenshuo/muduo/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u738d92ce\" id=\"u738d92ce\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4b4ae528\" id=\"u4b4ae528\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">https://github.com/chenshuo/muduo</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u0278518e\" id=\"u0278518e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">   </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9decdcc6\" id=\"u9decdcc6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1c6f25c8\" id=\"u1c6f25c8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud7509c52\" id=\"ud7509c52\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36a9dc19\" id=\"u36a9dc19\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">而我们自己写的仓库：</span><a href=\"https://github.com/youngyangyang04/muduo-core\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u44d8e472\" id=\"u44d8e472\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc0fabb4c\" id=\"uc0fabb4c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">https://github.com/youngyangyang04/muduo-core</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uf643bd5a\" id=\"uf643bd5a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">，是实现了muduo最核心的部分，这样方便大家可以在这个最基础的版本上自己做拓展。例如去实现 内存池、连接池、日志库、定时器 等等。  </span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"wtr2A\" id=\"wtr2A\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u805259a0\" id=\"u805259a0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">技术要求</span></strong></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ued098e74\" id=\"ued098e74\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub772221e\" id=\"ub772221e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">所需要的基础知识</span></strong></p><ul list=\"u4ea14069\"><li fid=\"u045119a4\" data-lake-id=\"ubcb7f952\" id=\"ubcb7f952\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaaea7079\" id=\"uaaea7079\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">熟悉最基本的TCP网络通信编程流程和API，比如socket、bind、listen、accept、recv、send</span></li><li fid=\"u045119a4\" data-lake-id=\"u371146f1\" id=\"u371146f1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud0666a45\" id=\"ud0666a45\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">了解epoll相关函数的用法，比如epoll_create，epoll_wait</span></li><li fid=\"u045119a4\" data-lake-id=\"u100271f6\" id=\"u100271f6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2f742a4e\" id=\"u2f742a4e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">了解Reactor事件处理模式</span></li><li fid=\"u045119a4\" data-lake-id=\"uae611013\" id=\"uae611013\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6c501257\" id=\"u6c501257\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">了解C++11常见新特性，如智能指针，function和bind等</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u4ffb2bad\" id=\"u4ffb2bad\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5975da36\" id=\"u5975da36\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"29c80db5\" id=\"29c80db5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3fe5bb6f\" id=\"u3fe5bb6f\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">开发环境</span></h2><ul list=\"u9dc69830\"><li fid=\"u7dfcc69a\" data-lake-id=\"u2ead0e5b\" id=\"u2ead0e5b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7c8b5e66\" id=\"u7c8b5e66\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">linux kernel version5.15.0-113-generic (ubuntu 22.04.6)</span></li><li fid=\"u7dfcc69a\" data-lake-id=\"u34be1940\" id=\"u34be1940\"><span data-lake-id=\"u14d302bb\" id=\"u14d302bb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">gcc (Ubuntu 11.4.0-1ubuntu1~22.04) 11.4.0</span></li><li fid=\"u7dfcc69a\" data-lake-id=\"u03c290d2\" id=\"u03c290d2\"><span data-lake-id=\"udf215f36\" id=\"udf215f36\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">cmake version 3.22</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"1f9ee1b3\" id=\"1f9ee1b3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u65f705f5\" id=\"u65f705f5\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">并发模型</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u3f48f351\" id=\"u3f48f351\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcamo.githubusercontent.com%2F6e5c964e6d7ca51cf1fca5d8bbbbb8882225252f6cfddc5e90f297e332c230e7%%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22link%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcamo.githubusercontent.com%2F6e5c964e6d7ca51cf1fca5d8bbbbb8882225252f6cfddc5e90f297e332c230e7%%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A937%2C%22originHeight%22%3A630%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22HY8TU%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(9, 105, 218)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u472772b4\" id=\"u472772b4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9a843686\" id=\"u9a843686\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">项目采用主从 多Reactor多线程 模型，MainReactor 只负责监听派发新连接，在 MainReactor 中通过 Acceptor 接收新连接并通过设计好的轮询算法派发给 SubReactor，SubReactor 负责此连接的读写事件。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7495f8f2\" id=\"u7495f8f2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u440e1db4\" id=\"u440e1db4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">调用 TcpServer 的 start 函数后，会内部创建线程池。每个线程独立的运行一个事件循环，即 SubReactor。MainReactor 从线程池中轮询获取 SubReactor 并派发给它新连接，处理读写事件的 SubReactor 个数一般和 CPU 核心数相等。使用主从 Reactor 模型有诸多优点：</span></p><ol list=\"u2e5016de\"><li fid=\"u013dd7e0\" data-lake-id=\"u2f91bdfc\" id=\"u2f91bdfc\"><span data-lake-id=\"uce897c82\" id=\"uce897c82\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">响应快，不必为单个同步事件所阻塞，虽然 Reactor 本身依然是同步的；</span></li><li fid=\"u013dd7e0\" data-lake-id=\"ub95778b5\" id=\"ub95778b5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5d9ea3c2\" id=\"u5d9ea3c2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">可以最大程度避免复杂的多线程及同步问题，并且避免多线程/进程的切换；</span></li><li fid=\"u013dd7e0\" data-lake-id=\"udfbc5f8a\" id=\"udfbc5f8a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u560b1537\" id=\"u560b1537\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">扩展性好，可以方便通过增加 Reactor 实例个数充分利用 CPU 资源；</span></li><li fid=\"u013dd7e0\" data-lake-id=\"uaeab1681\" id=\"uaeab1681\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucb9d7ef1\" id=\"ucb9d7ef1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">复用性好，Reactor 模型本身与具体事件处理逻辑无关，具有很高的复用性；</span></li></ol><h2 data-lake-id=\"da4790b3\" id=\"da4790b3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u712b40fe\" id=\"u712b40fe\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">构建项目</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u93227790\" id=\"u93227790\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7ba1058d\" id=\"u7ba1058d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">安装基本工具</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20apt-get%20update%5Cnsudo%20apt-get%20install%20-y%20wget%20cmake%20build-essential%20unzip%20git%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qty74%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"43cd7d53\" id=\"43cd7d53\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud83141e6\" id=\"ud83141e6\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">编译指令</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uf04c1424\" id=\"uf04c1424\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud5df7374\" id=\"ud5df7374\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">下载项目</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u22ba2c0d\" id=\"u22ba2c0d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9e3abb6f\" id=\"u9e3abb6f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40); background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250)\">git clone https://github.com/youngyangyang04/muduo-core.git</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0a90bc5c\" id=\"u0a90bc5c\"><span data-lake-id=\"udee52c2e\" id=\"udee52c2e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">进入到muduo-core文件</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud45d40c7\" id=\"ud45d40c7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufb038117\" id=\"ufb038117\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40); background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250)\">cd muduo-core</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9c213953\" id=\"u9c213953\"><span data-lake-id=\"u199a9070\" id=\"u199a9070\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">创建build文件夹，并且进入build文件:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3ea2d147\" id=\"u3ea2d147\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1f90f3e9\" id=\"u1f90f3e9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40); background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250)\">mkdir build &amp;&amp; cd build</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u09352763\" id=\"u09352763\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub50414af\" id=\"ub50414af\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">然后生成可执行程序文件：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue413aaef\" id=\"ue413aaef\"><span data-lake-id=\"u350fd72f\" id=\"u350fd72f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40); background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250)\">cmake .. &amp;&amp; make -j${nproc}</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uad441bb3\" id=\"uad441bb3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u49789ff9\" id=\"u49789ff9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">运行程序，进入example文件夹，并且执行可执行程序</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub3daefe1\" id=\"ub3daefe1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u31fbe08c\" id=\"u31fbe08c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40); background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250)\">cd example  &amp;&amp;  ./testserver</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"HZQQ1\" id=\"HZQQ1\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u620d40fc\" id=\"u620d40fc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">版本环境： </span></strong></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u0f577c60\" id=\"u0f577c60\" class=\"lake-lineheight-2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u53f703bb\" id=\"u53f703bb\" style=\"color: #333333\">建议购买一台云服务器，腾讯云或者阿里云，用来部署自己的项目 非常方便，无论是做本项目还是做其他项目，无论是自己练习，还是项目上线，都需要一台有公网Ip的独立服务器。 自己电脑安装虚拟机，不仅麻烦，进场出莫名其妙的问题。</span></strong></p><ul list=\"u8884d6e4\"><li fid=\"u27e1547b\" data-lake-id=\"uc3efcfc2\" id=\"uc3efcfc2\"><a href=\"https://www.aliyun.com/minisite/goods?taskCode=shareNew2205&amp;recordId=3641992&amp;userCode=roof0wob\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u9557a290\" id=\"u9557a290\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0f07ba2a\" id=\"u0f07ba2a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\">阿里云活动期间服务器购买</span></a></li><li fid=\"u27e1547b\" data-lake-id=\"u5b7fa5b9\" id=\"u5b7fa5b9\"><a href=\"https://curl.qcloud.com/EiaMXllu\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u8c8e241b\" id=\"u8c8e241b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u47e4866a\" id=\"u47e4866a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\">腾讯云活动期间服务器购买</span></a></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u62f3a066\" id=\"u62f3a066\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"nw3Zh\" id=\"nw3Zh\"><span data-lake-id=\"u15653d41\" id=\"u15653d41\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参考书籍</span></h2><ul list=\"ub6d399b9\"><li fid=\"u87cd5052\" data-lake-id=\"u23b95f7c\" id=\"u23b95f7c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3ba753ef\" id=\"u3ba753ef\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">陈硕（官方）：</span><a href=\"https://github.com/chenshuo/muduo/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u28385e45\" id=\"u28385e45\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7788ee98\" id=\"u7788ee98\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">https://github.com/chenshuo/muduo/</span></a></li><li fid=\"u87cd5052\" data-lake-id=\"u3d83ee9b\" id=\"u3d83ee9b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6d7467fd\" id=\"u6d7467fd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">《Linux多线程服务器编程-使用 muduo C++网络库》-陈硕</span></li><li fid=\"u87cd5052\" data-lake-id=\"uf733963f\" id=\"uf733963f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u729d9416\" id=\"u729d9416\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">《Linux高性能服务器编程》-游双</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u9912c49b\" id=\"u9912c49b\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"r2o33\" id=\"r2o33\"><br></h2>",
